  "bio": "Buckley, hailing from Chester in the United Kingdom, is a tattoo artist renowned for their exceptional skill in traditional and illustrative styles. As the resident artist at Lovers Chester, Buckley offers bespoke tattoos by appointment, ensuring each piece is crafted with the highest degree of professionalism. Their portfolio also extends to commissioned paintings and a curated collection of NFTs, showcasing versatility and a refined artistic vision.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Chester, England, United Kingdom",
